B.b2w=new A.M("Does Pact promise that a deal will close?","No. Closing depends on the parties, financing, diligence and the agreements they make.")
B.b2R=new A.M("Where should I ask about platform terms?","Use the company contact details on the Contact page when they are available. For obligations in a specific deal, speak to the parties and your adviser.")
B.as9=s([B.b2w,B.b2R],t.L)
B.aiy=new A.ka("Terms","PACT","A shared understanding of the platform.","Read how Pact\u2019s tools, professional directory and transaction workspaces are intended to be used. Agree deal-specific obligations and professional services separately with the people involved.","",B.asa,B.as9)
